.TH WAVE-LIST 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-list \- List the packages you have installed, with their versions, in two columns.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave list [\-\-raw]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the packages you have installed, with their versions, in two
columns.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-raw
Plain output for scripts: one name per line, no emoji, no columns

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave list
wave list --raw
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
